---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const pageTitle = "PostPulsar Pro Plan - Ultimate AI Content Repurposing";
---
<style>
  .custom-button {
    background-color: #ff4500;
    color: #ffffff;
    padding: 1rem 2rem;
    border-radius: 0.25rem;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
    display: inline-block;
  }
  .custom-button:hover {
    background-color: #e63e00;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(255, 69, 0, 0.4);
  }
</style>

<Layout title={pageTitle} hideHeader={true}>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    {/* WarriorPlus Tracking Pixel */}
    <img src="https://warriorplus.com/o2/btn/pn140011011/lw0d42/l497z7/451267" height="1" width="1" style="visibility: hidden; position: absolute;" alt="" />
  </Fragment>
  
  <main class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center min-h-screen bg-[#0a0a0a] text-[#e0e0e0] p-4 sm:p-8 font-[IBM Plex Mono]">
    <div class="max-w-4xl text-center">
      
      <!-- Headline -->
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold mb-4 leading-tight uppercase">
        Stop Wasting Hours Repurposing Content
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl sm:text-2xl text-[#ff4500] mb-8">
        Turn <span class="font-bold">One</span> Blog Post into a <span class="font-bold">Full Social Media Campaign</span> with AI.
      </p>
      
      <!-- Problem -->
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-300 mb-12 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Tired of the endless copy-pasting, reformatting, and brainstorming to adapt your content for every social network? You write one great article, but turning it into engaging posts for Twitter, LinkedIn, and Instagram feels like a full-time job. It's time to automate the grunt work.
      </p>

      <!-- Solution -->
      <div class="bg-gray-800/20 p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-xl border border-[#ff4500]/30 mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold mb-4 uppercase">Introducing: PostPulsar Pro Plan</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-200">
          Your AI-Powered Content Repurposing Engine. We give you the power to multiply your content, maximize your reach, and reclaim your time.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- What You Get Section -->
      <div class="text-left mb-12">
        <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-8 uppercase">Here’s What You Get With The Pro Plan:</h3>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          
          <div class="bg-gray-800/20 p-6 rounded-lg border border-gray-700/50">
            <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#ff4500] mb-2 uppercase">Component #1: 500 "Pulses"</h4>
            <p class="text-gray-300">Your AI "fuel" to generate hundreds of pieces of content. This massive bank of credits allows you to run multiple campaigns without worrying about limits.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gray-800/20 p-6 rounded-lg border border-gray-700/50">
            <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#ff4500] mb-2 uppercase">Component #2: Multi-Platform AI Generation</h4>
            <p class="text-gray-300">Generate unique, optimized content for all major platforms: LinkedIn, Twitter/X, Instagram, Threads, Telegram, and Discord.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gray-800/20 p-6 rounded-lg border border-gray-700/50">
            <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#ff4500] mb-2 uppercase">Component #3: Image & Video Publishing</h4>
            <p class="text-gray-300">Go beyond text. The Pro plan unlocks the ability to post rich media, including images and videos, for maximum engagement.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gray-800/20 p-6 rounded-lg border border-gray-700/50">
            <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#ff4500] mb-2 uppercase">Component #4: YouTube Video Transcription</h4>
            <p class="text-gray-300">Turn your (or anyone's) YouTube videos into a source of infinite content. Our AI transcribes the video, allowing you to create articles and social posts from it.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gray-800/20 p-6 rounded-lg border border-gray-700/50">
            <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#ff4500] mb-2 uppercase">Component #5: AI Quote Image Generator</h4>
            <p class="text-gray-300">Automatically pull impactful quotes from your text and turn them into shareable quote images using our built-in templates.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-gray-800/20 p-6 rounded-lg border border-gray-700/50">
            <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#ff4500] mb-2 uppercase">Component #6: Full Pro Access for 30 Days</h4>
            <p class="text-gray-300">This is a one-time payment that unlocks all Pro features for 30 days. No recurring subscriptions, no hidden fees.</p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Call to Action -->
      <div class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold mb-6 uppercase">Get Instant Access to the PostPulsar Pro Plan!</h2>
        
        <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">$29</div>
        <p class="text-gray-400 mb-6">One-Time Payment for 30 Days of Pro Access</p>

        <!-- WarriorPlus Buy Button - Styled -->
        <a href="https://warriorplus.com/o2/buy/lw0d42/l497z7/n1fhb9" class="custom-button">
          Buy Now
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Footer & Disclaimer -->
      <footer class="mt-12 text-gray-400 text-sm">
        <!-- WarriorPlus Salespage Disclaimer Code -->
        <script type="text/javascript" src="https://warriorplus.com/o2/disclaimer/lw0d42" defer></script>
        <div class="wplus_spdisclaimer text-xs p-4 border border-gray-700 rounded-md bg-gray-800 max-w-3xl mx-auto"></div>
        <p class="mt-4">
          All rights reserved. PostPulsar.
        </p>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>